<title>TURKEY: Turkish end-June budget deficit 681.7 trln lira.</title>
<headline>Turkish end-June budget deficit 681.7 trln lira.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's budget deficit at the end of June stood at 681.7 trillion lira compared with 475.4 trillion a year earlier, the Treasury said in a statement.</p>
</text>
